# Every text file is checked out with LF on every platform. The hooks hash the worker contract, the lints match
# headings and frontmatter line by line, and the plugin cache is a git clone on the user's host; a CRLF checkout
# (Git for Windows default core.autocrlf=true) would change hashes and break the regexes.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary
